  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 259
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What is the relationship between the speakers?",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 260
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "常见 teacher/student, doctor/patient, customer/",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 261
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "staff, colleagues, friends, family。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 262
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 263
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "人物关系通过身份、职责、称呼、请求方式表现。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 264
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “谁在对谁做什么？谁有权要求谁做什么？”",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 265
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 同一句 Please finish this by Friday 在工作场景和课堂场景都可能出现，所以要",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 266
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "结合任务对象。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 267
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 268
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先看选项中的关系差异。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 269
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听称呼、工作内容、课程/付款/诊疗等角色线索。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 270
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 判断双方权力和职责：谁布置任务、谁提供服务、谁求助。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 271
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 用整段关系而不是一句话定答案。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 272
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 273
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 274
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 275
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· homework / assignment / class → teacher-student",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 276
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· reservation / order / bill → staff-customer",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 277
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· symptom / medicine / appointment → doctor-patient",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 278
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· project / deadline / meeting → colleagues or boss-employee",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 279
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 角色职责能够解释双方至少两处话语。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 280
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若同事和朋友难区分，看是否出现明确工作职责；若师生和同学难区分，看是",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 281
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "否一方布置/评价学习任务。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 282
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 283
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Your essay is much clearer this time. Please revise the last paragraph before class.",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 284
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "评价作文并要求课前修改，明显是 teacher → student。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 285
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 286
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 根据年龄或男女声音猜关系。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 287
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只看一句礼貌程度判断。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 288
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 289
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 角色是否能解释双方行为？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 290
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有职业/课堂/家庭专属词？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 291
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 292
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 293
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 294
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 关系题先问：谁有责任对谁做什么？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 295
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 297
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “Please submit the essay before class.”关系最可能？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 298
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “Would you like anything else with your order?”",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 299
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. “Your blood pressure looks normal.”",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 300
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “The deadline for our project is Friday.”若双方都讨论分工，关系更可能？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 301
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 能不能根据男女声音直接判断husband/wife？",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 302
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. teacher-student；2. server/customer；3. doctor/patient；4. colleagues/classmates，需结合场景",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 303
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "进一步确认。；5. 不能。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 304
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L3”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 305
    }
